# rsync filter rules for "make install": the first matching rule wins. Plain lines are excludes;
# "+ /models/<name>/" includes a model directory and must precede "- /models/*", which drops every
# other model; "+ /models/NOTICE" keeps their license notices. A "!" line clears all previous
# rules in rsync, so gitignore-style negation must not be used. "make check-buildignore" verifies
# the result.
examples
models/arcface
models/auraface
models/scrfd
README.md
Thumbs.db
*~
docs
.*
_*
- /models/yunet/face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
+ /models/NOTICE
+ /models/efficientformerv2_s2/
+ /models/facenet/
+ /models/sface/
+ /models/yahoo_open_nsfw/
+ /models/yunet/
- /models/*
